# Findings the image scan should stay quiet about, with the reason and the
# condition for looking again. Nothing goes in here to make a red mark green:
# if a line cannot say why, the finding gets fixed instead.

# msgpack 1.1.2, high. Not a dependency of Evermind: it is vendored inside pip
# itself, where it deserialises pip's own HTTP cache. The container never runs
# pip, so the code is unreachable at runtime, and there is nothing to upgrade
# on our side. Every released pip up to 26.2.1 still vendors 1.1.2; only pip's
# main branch has moved to the fixed 1.2.1.
# Remove this line once a pip release ships msgpack >= 1.2.1, and the rebuild
# will clear it on its own.
